%% Saga orquestrada — caminho feliz (ADR-010)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Recepção
    actor M as Mecânico
    actor C as Cliente
    participant OS as OS Service<br/>(orquestrador)
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant EX as Execution
    participant BI as Billing
    participant MP as Mercado Pago

    R->>OS: POST /service-orders
    Note over OS: tx: OS received + saga + outbox
    OS-)MQ: cmd.execution.enqueue_diagnosis
    MQ-)EX: enfileira diagnóstico
    EX-)OS: evt.execution.diagnosis_enqueued
    M->>EX: POST /executions/{id}/diagnosis/start
    EX-)OS: evt.execution.diagnosis_started → in_diagnosis
    M->>OS: POST /service-orders/{id}/items (peças)
    M->>EX: POST /executions/{id}/diagnosis/finish
    EX-)OS: evt.execution.diagnosis_completed
    OS-)BI: cmd.billing.create_budget (snapshot de preços)
    BI-)OS: evt.billing.budget_created → awaiting_approval
    C->>BI: POST /budgets/{id}/approve
    BI-)OS: evt.billing.budget_approved
    Note over OS: tx local: reserva de estoque
    OS-)EX: cmd.execution.enqueue_repair
    EX-)OS: evt.execution.repair_enqueued → approved
    M->>EX: POST /executions/{id}/repair/start
    EX-)OS: evt.execution.repair_started → in_execution (pivot)
    M->>EX: POST /executions/{id}/repair/finish
    EX-)OS: evt.execution.repair_finished → finalized
    OS-)BI: cmd.billing.request_payment
    BI->>MP: cria preferência (Checkout Pro)
    BI-)OS: evt.billing.payment_requested (checkout_url)
    C->>MP: paga no checkout
    loop payments:verify (a cada minuto)
        BI->>MP: busca pagamento por external_reference
    end
    BI-)OS: evt.billing.payment_confirmed → paid_at
    R->>OS: POST /service-orders/{id}/deliver → delivered (saga completed)
